menu "chargelatch MQTT"

    config DEVICE_MQTT_BROKER_URI
        string "Broker URI"
        default ""
        help
            Where the device connects once it is on Wi-Fi, e.g. mqtt://broker.example.com:1883.
            The project value is set in sdkconfig.defaults.

            To test against the dev EMQX from `pnpm services:up`, override it here with the LAN
            address of your machine (mqtt://192.168.x.y:1883), NOT localhost: the device is a
            separate host on your Wi-Fi. The override lands in your local, gitignored sdkconfig.
            If this is empty, device_mqtt_start() fails with a clear log line.

    config DEVICE_MQTT_KEEPALIVE_SECONDS
        int "Keepalive (seconds)"
        default 30
        range 5 600
        help
            The broker considers the device gone, and publishes its last will ("offline"), after
            1.5x this long without traffic.

endmenu
